{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014XdeEjanFWswaqwyXxhjqQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tSynthetic source-only review component. Do not execute it or install dependencies.\n2\tExternal runtime/deployment claims are not measurements. This repository is the complete implementation of the specific paths described below; components explicitly assigned to the host remain outside scope.\n3\tThe host launches the executable declared by package.json and .mcp.json. src/ is development source; release/ is the shipped runtime snapshot. The supplied client bounds operation arguments and refuses redirects. The host enforces an 8 KiB line limit before writing stdin; host enforcement is not supplied. Stderr is shipped to a diagnostics service whose readers must not receive LEDGER_TOKEN. This is a single-principal stdio component, not an HTTP server. Downstream response limits, credential revocation, host sandboxing and actual published-package provenance are outside scope.\n4\tLaunch working directory is this package root; the host supplies LEDGER_TOKEN from its secret store.\n5\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b5c08d33-fe28-44f4-afce-79cea10110c5","uuid":"d1e6a441-034f-4e78-866a-df0c76417653","timestamp":"2026-10-24T20:15:11.471Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-grader-8sqa41d2/repo/README.md","content":"Synthetic source-only review component. Do not execute it or install dependencies.\nExternal runtime/deployment claims are not measurements. This repository is the complete implementation of the specific paths described below; components explicitly assigned to the host remain outside scope.\nThe host launches the executable declared by package.json and .mcp.json. src/ is development source; release/ is the shipped runtime snapshot. The supplied client bounds operation arguments and refuses redirects. The host enforces an 8 KiB line limit before writing stdin; host enforcement is not supplied. Stderr is shipped to a diagnostics service whose readers must not receive LEDGER_TOKEN. This is a single-principal stdio component, not an HTTP server. Downstream response limits, credential revocation, host sandboxing and actual published-package provenance are outside scope.\nLaunch working directory is this package root; the host supplies LEDGER_TOKEN from its secret store.\n","numLines":5,"startLine":1,"totalLines":5}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_014XdeEjanFWswaqwyXxhjqQ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
